# Alfred writes its live preferences bundle straight into this directory (its
# sync folder points here), so a few paths are runtime state rather than config.

# Per-machine settings, keyed by a hash of the machine. Alfred writes one
# subdirectory per Mac that has ever opened this bundle — appearance, clipboard
# retention, per-machine hotkeys. Tracking them means every machine fights over
# every other machine's file.
Alfred.alfredpreferences/preferences/local/

.DS_Store
